# Pairs with CaptureStrictIsolation. The execute phase writes straight to the
# visible projection instead of staging a hidden bucket, so a capture can hold
# a saga's write before - or without - its commit.
MODULE: CaptureStrictIsolationPrepareWritesVisible
TARGET: CaptureStrictIsolation
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a prepare applies its write as committed instead of staging it
PERTURBS: Prepare

--- FIND
    /\ prep' = [prep EXCEPT ![t][sh] = TRUE]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<reg, deleg, epoch, dec, loc, term, expired>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ prep' = [prep EXCEPT ![t][sh] = TRUE]
    \* MUTATION: the write lands visible, as if already committed.
    /\ term' = [term EXCEPT ![t][sh] = "commit"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<reg, deleg, epoch, dec, loc, expired>>
--- END
